[# comparison/old-vs-new: two columns of points, the old way with dashes and the new way with check marks.

   For "what changed" and "why switch" messages. On phones the columns stack, old first.

   Compatibility
   - Outlook desktop: two columns as a table row, marks are text glyphs.
   - Gmail apps: stacking works. Gmail on non-Google accounts drops media queries and shows the desktop layout.
   - Dark mode: swaps via dm-* classes when on the brand surface or background color. #]
[% set left = [{ component: 'content/heading', data: { text: data.oldTitle }, settings: { level: 'h3', tag: 'h3', color: '@colors.mutedText' } }, { component: 'content/list', data: { items: data.old }, variant: 'dashed', settings: { markerColor: '@colors.mutedText' } }] %]
[% set right = [{ component: 'content/heading', data: { text: data.newTitle }, settings: { level: 'h3', tag: 'h3', color: '@colors.accent', darkMode: false } }, { component: 'content/list', data: { items: data.new }, variant: 'checklist', settings: { markerColor: '@colors.success' } }] %]
[% if data.heading %]
[[ c('layout/section', { content: [{ component: 'content/heading', data: { text: data.heading }, settings: { level: 'h2', align: 'center', padding: '@spacing.sm' } }] }, { settings: { background: s.background, padding: s.paddingY + ' ' + s.paddingX + ' 0 ' + s.paddingX, hideOnMobile: s.hideOnMobile, hideOnDesktop: s.hideOnDesktop } }) ]]
[% endif %]
[[ c('layout/columns', { columns: [left, right] }, { settings: { split: '50/50', valign: 'top', background: s.background, padding: s.paddingY + ' ' + s.paddingX, columnPadding: '0 @spacing.sm', hideOnMobile: s.hideOnMobile, hideOnDesktop: s.hideOnDesktop } }) ]]
